+---
+import TenderHubLayout from "../../layouts/TenderHubLayout.astro";
+---
+
+<TenderHubLayout
+  title="Transport Sector Tenders in South Africa"
+  description="Government transport tender opportunities — fleet services, scholar and public transport, rail and aviation infrastructure, and roads-adjacent procurement."
+  hubType="Sector"
+  hubName="Transport"
+  contextLabel="transport"
+  lastUpdated="2026-05-14"
+>
+  <h2>About transport procurement</h2>
+  <p>
+    Transport-sector tenders span provincial scholar transport contracts, government fleet leasing and
+    maintenance, rail and aviation infrastructure procurement (Transnet, Prasa, ACSA), and a continuous
+    flow of roads-adjacent services such as traffic signal maintenance, signage, and road marking.
+    Major procuring entities include the Department of Transport, provincial transport departments,
+    Transnet, Prasa, ACSA, the RTMC, and metropolitan municipalities operating BRT systems.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Detailed sector hub — coming soon</h2>
+  <p>
+    We're building a detailed transport-sector hub covering the major procuring entities, typical contract
+    structures, key compliance requirements (operating licences, K53, PrDP, vehicle roadworthiness, sectoral
+    determinations), and the recurring tender categories. Join the waitlist below to be notified when it
+    publishes.
+  </p>
+
+  <p>
+    In the meantime, the
+    <a href="https://www.etenders.gov.za" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">eTenders Publication Portal</a>
+    lists all current transport-sector tenders. Filter by category and by organ of state.
+  </p>
+</TenderHubLayout>
diff --git a/src/pages/tenders/western-cape.astro a/src/pages/tenders/western-cape.astro
